OL,3,GNEWSADozens of firefighters tackle
OL,4,Ahouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews remained at the scene of a
OL,7,Fhouse fire in Birmingham on Sunday
OL,8,Fafter more than twenty firefighters
OL,9,Fspent Saturday night dealing with the
OL,10,Fblaze.
OL,12,FWest Midlands Fire Service (WMFS) said
OL,13,F10 fire engines had attended the scene
OL,14,Fat Drayton Road in Kings Heath on
OL,15,FSaturday night.
OL,17,FIn an update issued to the BBC, the
OL,18,Fservice said that two fire engines were
OL,19,Fstill in the area after they were
OL,20,Finitially called at 21:40 BST.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
