OL,3,GNEWSADozens of firefighters tackle
OL,4,Ahouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA WMFS spokesperson confirmed on Sunday
OL,7,Fmorning that some nearby residents had
OL,8,Fbeen evacuated, but they were unable to
OL,9,Fconfirm the cause of the fire or if
OL,10,Fanyone had been injured.
